NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the *code* in this repository only.

The datasets released alongside it are licensed separately and are NOT covered
by the terms above:

  - NWeak/CBM-user-study-cub      CC-BY-4.0
  - NWeak/CBM-user-study-emails   CC-BY-4.0
  - NWeak/emails-mirror           CC-BY-4.0, derived from the PhishingSpamDataSet
                                  of Toth, Bisztray and Dubniczky
                                  (arXiv:2511.21448); attribution required
  - NWeak/emails-user-study       CC-BY-4.0, same source and attribution
  - NWeak/cub-mirror              CUB-200-2011 non-commercial research-use terms
                                  (Wah et al. 2011); we do not own these images

See each dataset card on the HuggingFace Hub, and the Acknowledgments section
of README.md, for the full attribution requirements.
